        <p><seg source="#source-180894-180915">│ヨブ　　│　</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-180915-180946"><seg source="#source-180915-180917">20</seg></hi><seg source="#source-180946-180970">　│総計　　│　</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-180970-181001"><seg source="#source-180970-180972">42</seg></hi><seg source="#source-181001-181009">　│</seg></p>
